      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a bit confused by this. Nothing in this file can set use_arm_neon_optimizations to false on Android from what I can tell. Upstream chromium has a arm_use_neon declare_arg that bots conceivably could set, but this file here doesn\u0027t have anything like that. So I don\u0027t think this could ever be hit on arm?",
